# Home with some history (Listen and Library), then Stats: minutes listened, charts and rankings.
Output docs/stats.gif
Source tapes/style.tape

Hide
Type "tapes/demo.sh history"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

# Home
Sleep 3s
# to Stats
Tab@400ms 6
Sleep 3s
# artists
Right
Sleep 2.5s
# the month
Type "t"
Sleep 2.5s
# the year
Type "t"
Sleep 3s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
